    "9c85cecbb7c754645dd023d41cf1c8f86b10207b024d9b9ff0251e28ec7fea7b": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "ed6d93b7246fc9d25dd8da191f36d775440d1c7959d9209c6d00cbabf00d5561",
      "contextFingerprint": "334381918947006220c8b5c8283d156f6a6b45bd733498b9b44cda81462f819d",
      "sourceText": "上实物前需要核对输入位姿究竟代表 IMU 还是雷达、逆旋转后的轴向，以及这个窗口的筛选目的。雷达自身系已经扣除安装姿态，不应把整机倾斜角随意加到视场上下界；这里度制的阈值也不能与弧度制 JointState 混用。MID360 随实际 yaw、不随实际 pitch 转动的机械约定继续保留。",
      "translatedText": "Before running on the real hardware, it is necessary to verify whether the input pose represents the IMU or the LiDAR, the axes after inverse rotation, and the filtering purpose of this window\\. The LiDAR's own frame has already accounted for the mounting orientation; the overall tilt angle should not be arbitrarily added to the upper and lower bounds of the field of view\\. Also, thresholds in degrees here must not be mixed with radian\\-based JointState\\. The mechanical convention that the MID360 rotates with the actual yaw but not with the actual pitch is retained\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 212,
        "outputTokens": 119,
        "costUsd": 0.000207
      }
    },
