      "sourceText": "这项影响“激光匹配结果对位姿有多大作用”。但本地代码的两个求解分支方向不一致，不能简单记成“调大就少信雷达”。",
      "translatedText": "This affects \"how much the laser matching result contributes to the pose\\.\" However, the two solving branches in the local code have inconsistent directions, so it cannot be simply recorded as \"increasing it makes the radar less trusted\\.\"",
